[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-026
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Finished report or the reason
STATEMENT: >>>
`finished_report` raises 404 "Report not found or expired." when `job_store.get` returns none, 202 "Analysis
still in progress." while the job is processing, 422 with the job's error (or "Analysis failed.") when it
failed, and 404 when a complete job has no report; otherwise it returns the report.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: api
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-027
STATUS: Active
