[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-035
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Trends route
STATEMENT: >>>
`GET /trends/{airframe_label}` gives 400 "Invalid airframe label." for a label that normalises to none, applies
the token check, and answers `airframe_label`, `flight_count` and `flights`: for each flight of LLR-API-067,
`report_id`, `file_name`, `created_at` (upload time), `overall_score`, `letter_grade`, `module_scores`
(LLR-API-036) and `key_metrics` keyed `<analyser>.<name>`.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
