- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-019

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-036
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Module score of a flight
STATEMENT: >>>
`_module_score` gives null for a module that is skipped or whose `assessed` is false, otherwise its
`health_score`.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: api
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-019
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-037
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Comparison route
STATEMENT: >>>
`GET /diff?a=<id>&b=<id>` gives 400 "Cannot diff a report against itself." when `a` equals `b`, applies
LLR-API-026 to `a` and then `b`, and answers `a` and `b` (each `report_id`, `file_name`, `overall_score`,
`letter_grade`, `score_label`), `overall_score_delta` (b minus a, rounded to 2 decimals), `module_score_deltas`,
`findings_diff` and `key_metric_deltas`. No token is asked.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: api
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-038
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Score and metric changes
STATEMENT: >>>
`_deltas` gives, for every key in either report in sorted order, `{"a", "b", "delta"}`, with `delta` b minus a
