[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-090
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Maintenance status
STATEMENT: >>>
`compute_maintenance_status` gives `total_flight_hours` (sum of the flights' `duration_seconds` / 3600),
`hours_since_maintenance` (the same over flights uploaded at or after 00:00 UTC of the last log entry's date;
all flights when there is no entry or its date does not parse) and `maintenance_due` (an interval is set and
the hours since are at least the interval).
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: api
COMMENT: >>>
Flights are counted by upload time, not by when they were flown, so a log flown before a maintenance entry and
uploaded after it counts as flown since.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-018

