[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-094
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Verification of a change
STATEMENT: >>>
`verify(before, after, names)` returns `pending` with empty lists when `after` is none. Otherwise, over findings
whose `params` (upper case) meet the changed names (upper case): `findings_resolved` are such titles of before
whose `kind` (or title) is not in after, `findings_new` the reverse; `metric_deltas` holds `overall_score` and
`module.<name>` (2 decimals) for modules tied to those findings and assessed in both. The status is `improved`
when something resolved or a module change (the overall change when there is none) is 2.0 points or more,
`worse` when something is new or a change is -2.0 or less, `mixed` when both, else `unchanged`.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: api
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-021

