`validate_webhook_url` raises `UnsafeWebhookURLError` when the address is longer than 2048 characters or holds
whitespace or a character below 0x20, its scheme is not `https` (or `http` when `ALLOW_HTTP_WEBHOOKS` is true),
it has no host or a bad port, the host does not resolve, or any resolved address (an IPv4-mapped IPv6 address
taken as IPv4) is not global or is multicast; otherwise it returns the resolved addresses.
