STATEMENT: >>>
`send_alert_webhook` posts the JSON `{"content": <text>, "text": <text>}` with `Content-Type: application/json`
and `User-Agent: FlightMD-webhook`, where the text is a first line naming the airframe label and report id and
one line per breached rule with its label (or metric), value to 3 significant digits, `<` or `>` and the
threshold.
<<<
