[REQUIREMENT]
UID: LLR-API-099
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Alert delivery
STATEMENT: >>>
`send_alert_webhook` returns false without connecting when the address fails LLR-API-097; otherwise it sends one
POST to the address's path and query, connecting to the first checked address with TLS checked against the
host name, a 5 s timeout, no redirect followed and no retry, and returns true only for a 2xx status. It never
raises.
<<<
VERIFICATION: Test
ALLOCATION: api
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HLR-API-023

